{"synopsis":"Seorang sosiopat gila, Monster yang memakai kulit manusia, Iblis dari garis depan utara, dan Eksekutor yang menyeringai.\n\nAku harus bersikap layaknya seperti Julian, Karakter bermata-rubah gila yang ditakuti oleh seluruh kekaisaran.\n\n[Character Trait <Formal Speech>]\n\nAnda berbicara dengan formal kepada semua orang tanpa memandang usia.\n\n\"Bukannya sah-sah saja kalau aku bicara dengan diriku sendiri?\"","alternative_title":"완벽한 실눈 악역을 연기하다","author":"Spring and Autumn","artist":"80","chapters":[{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"0dd139aa-fd41-41dd-a403-710a8968e433","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-03-09"},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"448ea534-56dc-42b9-9508-ee71583d6a70","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-03-09"},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"2e446892-438b-46fa-9791-15d6a0a43174","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-03-09"},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"824d26e4-f404-4c3b-b97f-8cc2a5afe388","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-02-01"},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"951b736e-80f9-4ca0-a26b-1d331b7bed28","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-01-18"},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"e6fbeafd-9eef-4139-af53-490314df723f","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-01-12"},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"b85b4cc5-9d09-4b12-89eb-b8e39c9d75ea","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2026-01-12"},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"0958b870-1192-4b8c-9693-4c062b20ff9f","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2026-01-01"},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"98032a86-4abf-4d87-adbd-eec074024ed4","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-01-01"},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"eba75d01-40b7-4549-9e6d-3d9e4d83b0c0","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2025-12-22"},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"b8390c78-c629-46f1-b499-ff9262d60c4a","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2025-12-07"},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"488df5b4-0e32-44f4-878a-24bf2a1afc9a","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2025-11-29"},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"f54b47ff-0b8f-470e-a4bd-b